{"id":"9df3239945c5331e","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-lln.md","title":"Strong Law of Large Numbers","display":"thm-lln — Strong Law of Large Numbers","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-lln","aliases":["58-thm-lln"],"display":"thm-lln — Strong Law of Large Numbers","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-iid.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-lln"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-lln</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lln — Strong Law of Large Numbers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64b5bf078722d744\" href=\"?note=64b5bf078722d744\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-iid.md\">../batch07/58-df-iid.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-lln-—-Law-of-Large-Numbers\">thm-lln — Law of Large Numbers</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(X_i)_{i\\geq1}\">\\(X=(X_i)_{i\\geq1}\\)</span> (real-valued random variables), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (their common law on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\">\\((\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IID}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IID}_S\\)</span> (i.i.d.-family predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lln}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{IID}_S\\bigl(X,\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\mu;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\bigr)\n\\land\\int_{\\mathbb R}|x|\\,d\\mu(x)&lt;\\infty\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\n\\neg\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\left(N\\leq n\\to\\left|\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X(i)(\\xi)-\\int_{\\mathbb R}x\\,d\\mu(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\right\\}\\right)=0.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lln}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{IID}_S\\bigl(X,\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\mu;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\bigr)\n\\land\\int_{\\mathbb R}|x|\\,d\\mu(x)&lt;\\infty\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\n\\neg\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\left(N\\leq n\\to\\left|\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X(i)(\\xi)-\\int_{\\mathbb R}x\\,d\\mu(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\right\\}\\right)=0.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the strong law under the optimal first-moment hypothesis for an i.i.d. real-valued sequence; almost-sure convergence is expanded as a measurable exceptional set of probability zero.</li>\n<li>The probability space and measurable state space are explicit, matching the nine-place i.i.d. predicate rather than calling an undefined three-place abbreviation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-lln-—-Law-of-Large-Numbers","text":"thm-lln — Law of Large Numbers","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-iid.md","status":"resolved","id":"64b5bf078722d744","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-iid.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"X=(X_i)_{i\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IID}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lln}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{IID}_S\\bigl(X,\\mathbb N_{>0},\\mu;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\bigr)\n\\land\\int_{\\mathbb R}|x|\\,d\\mu(x)<\\infty\\to\\\\\n&\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\n\\neg\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\n\\left(N\\leq n\\to\\left|\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X(i)(\\xi)-\\int_{\\mathbb R}x\\,d\\mu(x)\\right|<\\varepsilon\\right)\\right\\}\\right)=0.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1404,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-lln.md|58-thm-lln]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["2e4ee9615831113b","64b5bf078722d744"]}